title: Falling Fifths in G minor
key: Gm
tempo: 138
style: jazz

// A thirty-two-bar standard form in which every chord falls a fifth to the
// next: round the relative major, then round the minor.
[A]
| Cm7   | F7   | Bbmaj7 | Ebmaj7 |
| Am7b5 | D7b9 | Gm6    | %      |

[A2]
| Cm7   | F7   | Bbmaj7 | Ebmaj7 |
| Am7b5 | D7b9 | Gm6    | %      |

[B]
| Am7b5 | D7b9 | Gm6    | %      |
| Cm7   | F7   | Bbmaj7 | Ebmaj7 |

[C]
| Am7b5  | D7b9       | Gm7 C7 | Fm7 Bb7 |
| Ebmaj7 | Am7b5 D7b9 | Gm6    | %       |
